        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ic cyðe eow þæt ic wylle beon hold hlaford ⁊ unswicende to Godes gerihtum ⁊ to rihtre woroldlage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And I declare to you that I will be a gracious lord, and will not fail to support the rights of the church and just secular law.</ab>
